From: Value Fabric Security Team <security@valuefabric.io>
Date: 2026-05-27
Subject: [PATCH-001] CRITICAL: Add RateLimitMiddleware to L7 Billing Service

This patch adds per-tenant rate limiting to the Layer 7 Billing service
and implements a dedicated rate limit for the Stripe webhook endpoint
to prevent abuse.

Before this patch:
  - GovernanceMiddleware was installed with rate_limiter=None, disabling
    ALL rate limiting on billing endpoints
  - The /v1/billing/webhook endpoint had no rate limiting protection,
    making it vulnerable to replay/dos attacks

After this patch:
  - RedisRateLimiter is initialized and wired into GovernanceMiddleware
  - Per-tenant rate limits are enforced on all billing endpoints
  - Stripe webhook endpoint has a dedicated 100 req/min rate limit
  - Fail-closed: if Redis is unavailable, requests are rejected

Security Impact: CRITICAL
Audit Ticket: SEC-2026-001
